<Tunnel title="Keep the USB Untouched | Save My Gig!" status="Critical · Safe Route" red>
  <div class="review-flag">DRAFT, review pending.</div>
  <div class="step-label">Safe route</div>
  <h2 style="margin-bottom:1rem">OK. We don't touch your USB.</h2>

  <p class="dim">Then we need <strong>any other USB drive</strong> for tonight.</p>

  <ul class="checklist">
    <li>Ask the other DJs, the promoter, the bar staff, someone has a pen drive.</li>
    <li>Even a small one works. You only need tonight's set.</li>
  </ul>

  <p class="question">Did you find another USB drive?</p>

  <Choice step="no_erase"
    a={{ href: '/protocol/critical/second-usb-format', label: 'YES, GOT ONE' }}
    b={{ href: '/protocol/critical/no-laptop-3', label: 'NO - NO OTHER USB HERE', desc: 'Survival mode: other ways to play tonight.' }}
  />
</Tunnel>
